# apps/web/media is deliberately NOT ignored. Payload writes uploads there via
# Media.upload.staticDir, and the 20 firm logos are the only contents. Ignoring
# them meant a deploy from this repo rendered every logo as a broken image.
# Once an S3/R2 storage adapter is configured, ignore this directory again and
# let the bucket own it.
